#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:329
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Component '%1' is currently active. Only global shortcuts currently not "
"active will be removed from the list.\n"
"All global shortcuts will reregister themselves with their defaults when "
"they are next started."
msgstr ""
"Anguaño'l componente «%1» ta activu. Namái los atayos globales que nun tean "
"activos anguaño van desaniciase de la llista.\n"
"Tolos atayos globales van rexistrase solo colos valores predeterminaos "
"cuando s'anicien la próxima vegada."

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:331 kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:341
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove component"
msgstr "Desaniciu del componente"

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:337
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove the registered shortcuts for component '%1'? "
"The component and shortcuts will reregister themselves with their default "
"settings when they are next started."
msgstr ""
"¿De xuru que quies desaniciar los atayos rexistraos del componente «%1»? El "
"componente y los atayos van rexistrase solos colos axustes predeterminaos "
"cuando s'anicien la próxima vegada."

